  "teHelpers": {
    "about": "Helper verbs after a verb's て-form folded into one segment (持っている). Only いる, いく/ゆく and くれる: Tatoeba, JMdict and MeCab write て | しまう, て | くる, て | ある … as two tokens, and so does the segmenter (2026-10-03: folding them all cut 7 gold tokens in held2k and gave してあれ | ほど). てゆく/ていく and てくれる fold by the user's own decision (named cases 飛び込んでゆく, 歌い続けてゆく; the hand-written benefactive rules). The contractions below fuse て with the helper in writing, so they do fold.",
